{"id":"vod_md_3321","vodId":"3321","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"境界的彼方","name_cn":"境界的彼方","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230826-1/b11d56efce295109c0874575f44c28b5.jpg"},"summary":"这个世界上存在着异形之物，其姿态千变万化，即为“妖梦”，以除去妖梦为业的，即为异界士。本作主人公神原秋人（KENN 配音），看起来是个普通的高二男生，实际上是由人类和妖梦结合而诞生的“半妖”。拥有不死之身的他，于某个黄昏，在校园天台遇见一名想要跳楼的少女栗山未来（种田梨纱 配音），出乎意料的是，少女居然对他发起了攻击。原来，看起来是个普通新生的眼镜美少女，竟是一名能够操纵血的异界士。拥有特殊能力的栗山未来，引起了异界士名门望族名濑家的注意。与秋人同为文艺部的名濑美月（茅原实里 配音）即是名濑家的次女，她嘱咐秋人远离栗山。肆虐的妖梦，孤独行走于世的异界士，以及罕有的半妖，在境界的彼方展开一个奇异的幻想故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-26 07:26:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/pBA0jt2I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/pdQZ1Xbi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/d3OdNzku/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/ZuYkneCC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/TV1V9H1F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/RXkgPgpX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/fZ5axtil/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/oZSqINu9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/jZMmmSNU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/RQ5Awuzc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/4MhU9KpL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Dpjl5rDr/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:43:29.727Z"}